    <h2 class="visually-hidden">条款</h2>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第一条</span><span class="clause__name">事由</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">本函就「城南契约档案之核验」一事，向贵科调取原件留存的骑缝印样，用以比对存卷副本的压印深度与压印次序。核验以纸面形变为准，不以墨色为准。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第二条</span><span class="clause__name">依据</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">依《文书档案核验规程》第十一条、第十九条办理；涉及一九四九年以前之卷宗，另依《旧档调阅办法》办理。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第三条</span><span class="clause__name">检送</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">检送一九八七年至一九九三年骑缝印样共十四件，分编为附件一至附件四；件数、状态与存放位置见附件目录。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第四条</span><span class="clause__name">期限</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">自签发之日起七个工作日内答复。逾期未复的，本函连同附件自动转呈复核科，并记入年度核验台账。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第五条</span><span class="clause__name">方式</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">回函一律用棉纸盲压件，不落墨、不着色。影印件、传真件与电子副本一律不予受理，因上述三种方式无法留存压印深度。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第六条</span><span class="clause__name">责任</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">本函由徵信核验科主稿，会签档案修复室；未经会签不得对外，不得拆分调阅，不得据以复制原件。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause" data-press>
      <h3 class="clause__head"><span class="clause__idx">第七条</span><span class="clause__name">附记</span><span class="depth"><code role="none">0.4mm</code></span></h3>
      <p class="clause__body">本函一式两份，正本存卷，副本送复核科备查。回函请于骑缝处加盖原章，并在末行末字处保留压印机收力的浅槽。</p>
    </section>

